rd things try  hard things and keep at it we could  certainly propose legislation to see if  people  support bunny rapids and ice cream but  that wouldn't be very rewarding to the  american people so the president's view  is we're going to keep pushing for hard  things to that end mr biden met again  last night with the two democrats  blocking his agenda and he vowed to keep  fighting for voting rights despite the  grim prospects if we missed the first  time  we could come back and try it a second  time  it wasn't all bad news for this white  house yesterday the supreme court did  uphold a new federal rule requiring  vaccinations in many medical settings  and the white house was able to announce  that it has procured 380 million covid  tests to be delivered for free to  americans across the country still this  is the kind of day that many white house  officials are probably waking up and  saying  thank goodness it's friday  tough road ahead for the president nancy  thank you very much as always appreciate  it
 

